# A golden transcript records what the library wrote, line by line.  A
# header line may end in a blank, and then the blank is the point of the
# case.
#
# This file is here and not at the top of the tree on purpose: one git am
# over a series that adds a top-level .gitattributes goes on warning for the
# later patches, which a file in this directory does not.
/*/expected whitespace=-blank-at-eol
